f33b1a2d081918778431a9cfca8ba/canva-translate-design\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d081918778431a9cfca8ba/canva-translate-design\",\"title\":\"canva-translate-design\",\"description\":\"Translate all text in a Canva design to another language, creating a translated copy. Faster than manually copying and editing each text box in Canva's editor. Use when users say \\\"translate my design to [language]\\\", \\\"make a Spanish/French/etc version\\\", or \\\"localize my Canva design\\\".\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d081918778431a9cfca8ba\",\"plugin_name\":\"canva\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_d575a12fb6c08191947fd0c8515cde27\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6c49c069008191adc16153cb86b667\",\"skill_name\":\"canva-translate-design\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d081918778431a9cfca8ba/canva-edit-design\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d081918778431a9cfca8ba/canva-edit-design\",\"title\":\"canva-edit-design\",\"description\":\"Make edits to an existing Canva design — change or fix text, replace/insert/delete images and videos, reformat text (size, weight, style, color, alignment, lists, line height), reposition or resize elements, and update the title. Use when the user wants to change, edit, update, fix, translate, replace, or reformat content in a specific Canva design. This is the safe edit engine that other Canva skills (e.g. implement-feedback) build on.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d081918778431a9cfca8ba\",\"plugin_name\":\"canva\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_d575a12fb6c08191947fd0c8515cde27\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6c49c0a7108191a6c21bbc5ded49a7\",\"skill_name\":\"canva-edit-design\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_68df33b1a2d0